# Files excluded from the archives built by `moon package` / `moon publish`.
#
# Publishing honors `.gitignore` by default, but a directory that has a
# `.moonignore` uses it *instead of* that directory's `.gitignore`, so the
# build and dependency directories ignored by `.gitignore` are repeated here.

# Build output and local dependency cache
_build/
target/
.mooncakes/
publish/

# Development-only material (the WHATWG spec is a git submodule)
/docs/
/scripts/
/spec/
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

# Test suites
*_test.mbt
*_wbtest.mbt
